"diffserv4, ingress 1, egress 1, nat 1, host_isolate 1, autorate_ingress 0. "
"device: samma utom nat 0. defaults: timeout 3600, dscp_default_tcp/udp CS0, "
"dscp_prio/dscp_bulk/dscp_icmp inte satta, bulk_trigger_pps/"
"bulk_trigger_timeout/prio_max_avg_pkt_len 0 (inaktiverat)."

